<!-- templates/builder/editable_templates/ModernEcommerce16/product_details_editable.html -->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Product Details - Luminae</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,300;14..32,400;14..32,500;14..32,600;14..32,700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --color-deep-charcoal: #2A2A34;
            --color-stone-teal: #5596AA;
            --color-mist-blue: #AABFD4;
            --color-lavender-frost: #E6E8F5;
            --color-dusty-lilac: #DCD7DD;
            --bg-primary: #E6E8F5;
            --text-primary: #2A2A34;
            --accent-soft: #5596AA;
            --border-light: rgba(42, 42, 52, 0.1);
            --transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        main {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.5;
            padding-top: 90px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        /* Breadcrumb */
        .breadcrumb {
            padding: 1rem 0;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: #6a6a78;
        }

        .breadcrumb a {
            color: var(--color-stone-teal);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Product Details Layout */
        .product-details {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        /* Product Gallery */
        .product-gallery {
            position: sticky;
            top: 120px;
        }

        .main-image {
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: white;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .main-image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .thumbnail-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .thumbnail {
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            transition: var(--transition);
            background: white;
        }

        .thumbnail img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .thumbnail.active {
            border-color: var(--color-stone-teal);
        }

        /* Product Info */
        .product-info {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .product-category {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--color-stone-teal);
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        h1.product-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--color-deep-charcoal);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        /* Rating */
        .product-rating {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .stars {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.25rem;
            color: #ffc107;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .rating-count {
            color: #6a6a78;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .review-link {
            color: var(--color-stone-teal);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        /* Price */
        .product-price {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--color-stone-teal);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .original-price {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #999;
            text-decoration: line-through;
            margin-left: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        /* Description */
        .product-description {
            color: #6a6a78;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* Variants */
        .variant-section {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .variant-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--color-deep-charcoal);
        }

        .color-options {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .color-option {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .color-option.active {
            border-color: var(--color-deep-charcoal);
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .size-options {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .size-option {
            padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: 40px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition);
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            background: white;
        }

        .size-option.active {
            background: var(--color-stone-teal);
            border-color: var(--color-stone-teal);
            color: white;
        }

        /* Quantity */
        .quantity-section {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .quantity-selector {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .quantity-btn {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            background: white;
            border-radius: 40px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.125rem;
        }

        .quantity-input {
            width: 60px;
            height: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        /* Action Buttons */
        .action-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn-buy-now {
            flex: 1;
            background: var(--color-deep-charcoal);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 40px;
            border: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .btn-add-to-cart {
            flex: 1;
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid var(--color-stone-teal);
            color: var(--color-stone-teal);
            padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .btn-wishlist {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            background: white;
            border-radius: 40px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        /* Product Meta */
        .product-meta {
            padding-top: 1.5rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: #6a6a78;
        }

        /* Tabs */
        .product-tabs {
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .tab-headers {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .tab-header {
            padding: 1rem 0;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #6a6a78;
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
        }

        .tab-header.active {
            color: var(--color-stone-teal);
        }

        .tab-header.active::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -1px;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--color-stone-teal);
        }

        .tab-content {
            display: none;
            padding: 1rem 0;
        }

        .tab-content.active {
            display: block;
            animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* Reviews */
        .review-form {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .star-rating-input {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .star-rating-input .star {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: #ddd;
        }

        .star-rating-input .star.active {
            color: #ffc107;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .form-group input,
        .form-group textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.875rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .btn-submit-review {
            background: var(--color-stone-teal);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 40px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .reviews-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .review-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .review-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .reviewer-name {
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .review-date {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #6a6a78;
        }

        /* Related Products */
        .related-products {
            margin-top: 4rem;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        }

        .related-products h2 {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .related-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .related-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: var(--transition);
            text-decoration: none;
            display: block;
        }

        .related-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .related-img {
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        .related-info {
            padding: 1rem;
        }

        .related-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--color-deep-charcoal);
        }

        .related-price {
            color: var(--color-stone-teal);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .empty-related {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            color: #6a6a78;
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .product-details {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .product-gallery {
                position: static;
            }
            .related-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            body {
                padding-top: 80px;
            }
            .container {
                padding: 0 1.25rem;
            }
            .product-info {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            .action-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .btn-wishlist {
                width: 100%;
            }
            .related-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                max-width: 350px;
                margin: 0 auto;
            }
            .tab-headers {
                gap: 1rem;
                overflow-x: auto;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <main>
        <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <div class="container">
        <div class="breadcrumb editable-section" data-section="71">
            <a href="#" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="72" data-text="47">Home</a>
            <span> / </span>
            <a href="#" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="73" data-text="48">Shop</a>
            <span> / </span>
            <span class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="74" data-text="49">Product Details</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Product Details -->
    <div class="container">
        <div class="product-details">
            <!-- Product Gallery -->
            <div class="product-gallery editable-section" data-section="75">
                <div class="main-image">
                    <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1571459/pexels-photo-1571459.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" alt="Main Product" id="mainProductImage" class="editable-image" data-image="11">
                </div>
                <div class="thumbnail-grid">
                    <div class="thumbnail active">
                        <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1571459/pexels-photo-1571459.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=200" alt="Thumbnail 1" data-image="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1571459/pexels-photo-1571459.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" class="editable-image" data-image="12">
                    </div>
                    <div class="thumbnail">
                        <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/2103509/pexels-photo-2103509.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=200" alt="Thumbnail 2" data-image="https://images.pexels.com/photos/2103509/pexels-photo-2103509.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" class="editable-image" data-image="13">
                    </div>
                    <div class="thumbnail">
                        <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/5882287/pexels-photo-5882287.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=200" alt="Thumbnail 3" data-image="https://images.pexels.com/photos/5882287/pexels-photo-5882287.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" class="editable-image" data-image="14">
                    </div>
                    <div class="thumbnail">
                        <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1746830/pexels-photo-1746830.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=200" alt="Thumbnail 4" data-image="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1746830/pexels-photo-1746830.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800" class="editable-image" data-image="15">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Product Info -->
            <div class="product-info editable-section" data-section="76">
                <div class="product-category editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="77" data-text="50">ACCESSORIES</div>
                <h1 class="product-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="78" data-text="51">Artisan Ceramic Vase</h1>
                
                <!-- Rating - Fully Editable -->
                <div class="product-rating editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="79">
                    <div class="stars editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="80">
                        <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="13" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="13" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="13" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star editable-icon" data-icon="13" data-default-class="fas fa-star"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star-half-alt editable-icon" data-icon="14" data-default-class="fas fa-star-half-alt"></i>
                    </div>
                    <span class="rating-count editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="81" data-text="52">4.8 (128 reviews)</span>
                    <a href="#reviews" class="review-link editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="82" data-text="53">Write a review</a>
                </div>

                <!-- Price -->
                <div class="product-price editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="83">
                    <span class="current-price editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="84" data-text="54">$89</span>
                    <span class="original-price editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="85" data-text="55">$129</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Description -->
                <p class="product-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="86" data-text="56">
                    A beautifully crafted ceramic vase with a unique artisanal finish. Perfect for displaying fresh flowers or as a standalone decorative piece.
                </p>

                <!-- Color Variants -->
                <div class="variant-section editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="87">
                    <div class="variant-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="88" data-text="57">Color</div>
                    <div class="color-options editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="89">
                        <div class="color-option active" style="background-color: #D4C4B0;" data-color="beige"></div>
                        <div class="color-option" style="background-color: #7A6A5C;" data-color="taupe"></div>
                        <div class="color-option" style="background-color: #C9B6A0;" data-color="cream"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Size Variants -->
                <div class="variant-section editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="90">
                    <div class="variant-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="91" data-text="58">Size</div>
                    <div class="size-options editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="92">
                        <div class="size-option active editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="93" data-text="59">Small (8")</div>
                        <div class="size-option editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="94" data-text="60">Medium (12")</div>
                        <div class="size-option editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="95" data-text="61">Large (16")</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Quantity -->
                <div class="quantity-section editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="96">
                    <div class="quantity-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="97" data-text="62">Quantity</div>
                    <div class="quantity-selector">
                        <button class="quantity-btn" id="decrementQty">-</button>
                        <input type="number" class="quantity-input" id="quantityInput" value="1" min="1" max="10">
                        <button class="quantity-btn" id="incrementQty">+</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Action Buttons -->
                <div class="action-buttons editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="98">
                    <button class="btn-buy-now editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="99" data-text="63">
                        <i class="fas fa-bolt editable-icon" data-icon="15" data-default-class="fas fa-bolt"></i> Buy Now
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn-add-to-cart editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="100" data-text="64">
                        <i class="fas fa-shopping-bag editable-icon" data-icon="11" data-default-class="fas fa-shopping-bag"></i> Add to Cart
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn-wishlist">
                        <i class="far fa-heart editable-icon" data-icon="12" data-default-class="far fa-heart"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Product Meta -->
                <div class="product-meta editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="101">
                    <p class="meta-item editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="102" data-text="65"><i class="fas fa-truck editable-icon" data-icon="16" data-default-class="fas fa-truck"></i> Free shipping on orders over $100</p>
                    <p class="meta-item editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="103" data-text="66"><i class="fas fa-undo-alt editable-icon" data-icon="17" data-default-class="fas fa-undo-alt"></i> 30-day easy returns</p>
                    <p class="meta-item editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="104" data-text="67"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt editable-icon" data-icon="18" data-default-class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> 2-year warranty</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tabs -->
        <div class="product-tabs editable-section" data-section="105">
            <div class="tab-headers editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="106">
                <button class="tab-header editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone active" data-tab="description" data-section="107" data-text="68">Description</button>
                <button class="tab-header editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-tab="specifications" data-section="108" data-text="69">Specifications</button>
                <button class="tab-header editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-tab="shipping" data-section="109" data-text="70">Shipping & Returns</button>
                <button class="tab-header editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-tab="reviews" data-section="110" data-text="71">Reviews (128)</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Description Tab -->
            <div class="tab-content active" id="description-tab">
                <div class="description-content editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="111" data-text="72">
                    <p>This Artisan Ceramic Vase is a celebration of traditional craftsmanship and modern design. Each piece is individually handcrafted by skilled artisans, ensuring no two are exactly alike. The unique glaze finish creates a subtle texture that catches light beautifully.</p>
                    <p>Perfect for displaying fresh flowers, dried botanicals, or simply as a sculptural accent piece. The versatile neutral tones complement any interior style, from minimalist to bohemian.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Specifications Tab -->
            <div class="tab-content" id="specifications-tab">
                <div class="specifications-content editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="112">
                    <div class="spec-item editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="113" data-text="73"><strong>Material:</strong> High-quality ceramic</div>
                    <div class="spec-item editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="114" data-text="74"><strong>Finish:</strong> Matte glaze</div>
                    <div class="spec-item editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="115" data-text="75"><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 8" H x 6" W (Small)</div>
                    <div class="spec-item editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="116" data-text="76"><strong>Weight:</strong> 2.5 lbs</div>
                    <div class="spec-item editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="117" data-text="77"><strong>Handcrafted:</strong> Yes</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Shipping Tab -->
            <div class="tab-content" id="shipping-tab">
                <div class="shipping-content editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="118" data-text="78">
                    <p><strong>Shipping:</strong> Free standard shipping on all orders over $100. Orders typically ship within 1-2 business days and arrive in 3-7 business days.</p>
                    <p><strong>Returns:</strong> We offer a 30-day return policy for all items in original condition. Please contact our support team to initiate a return.</p>
