                        <div class="review-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="131" data-text="87">Absolutely stunning!</div>
                        <div class="review-comment editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="132" data-text="88">This vase is even more beautiful in person. The craftsmanship is exceptional and it looks perfect in my living room.</div>
